Bruno Kazer wrote:
>
> At what level do you say to yourself that all future levels will come
> from potions of gain levels or wraiths, etc?  Myself, it does not seem
> so hard to get up to 20000 xp, but after that probably have to rely on
> other means than xp.  20000 is the xp for lvl 12.

It's a rolling target not a switch point.  Early levels are trivial to
gain by combat experience but every level that gets harder and the
amount of the dungeon explored gets larger.  Some methods for gaining
levels depend on attributes other than XP but the higher your XP the
better your chance of being able to use them.

So I'll go with any method I can get if I'm in a game where I've decided
I want more XP levels.


